ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5AlNuCCTpYMnZ06UjrXiRcOoSQQdTVjO8C7D5W9twYGA&oe=6A0C7EAF"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "200731254543910", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410197_827988217334297_882990334_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rAZ1e7MtD-0Q7kNvwFay1B4&_nc_oc=Adpmdl4wY0ljZ8sCQJYkQny_N0whbf7DRuvJR8dBEuJD0HIan5o9CzscmD0v7uQwwW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4jHuo3rZcVaqN6RJkz6QYMO_WvNjIYmVkoTR_sudNOGA&oe=6A0C619C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hypercade", "keywords": ["Classic", "Aracade", "Action"], "long_description": "Hypercade brings a modern spin to nostalgic arcade action in VR, with simple to use controls paired with classic arcade challenge.  Play four incredible arcade classics completely hands free or with a controller.  Brought to you by acclaimed VR game developer Hidden Path Entertainment, Hypercade includes four arcade games, each with its own unique take on fan favorites of yesteryear.    \n\nDodge dive-bombing aliens in Space Swarm, a classic vertical shooter featuring waves of unique enemy flight formations and challenging special bonus stages.  Evade the onslaught of multi-legged creatures in Crazy Critters, but beware - shoot them in the middle and they'll divide in half!  Save humanity from homicidal robots in Robo Rush, a classic twin-stick shooter featuring a unique hands-free mode.\n", "short_description": "Hypercade brings a modern spin to nostalgic arcade action in VR, with simple to use controls paired with classic arcade challenge.\n\nPlay four incredible arcade classics completely hands free or with a controller.  Brought to you by acclaimed VR game developer Hidden Path Entertainment, Hypercade includes four arcade games, each with its own unique take on fan favorites of yesteryear."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://hiddenpath.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_ser